    "details": {
      "alignment": "Lawful Neutral",
      "type": {
        "value": "humanoid",
        "subtype": "human"
      },
      "cr": 1,
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p><em>The Regal Lion packet sheet — Regal Lion Manor Guard.</em> Built by <code>tools/build-forge-packets.py</code> from the NPC Forge roster <code>data/forge/regal-lion.json</code> (entry <code>regal-lion-manor-guard</code>): Medium humanoid (human), Lawful Neutral; CR 1 (proficiency +2, to hit +4 with STR); AC 16 (chain mail &amp; lion heater shield), hit points 26 (4d8+8), speed 30 ft.. A GM scene kit for the The Regal Lion article's present (1040 BF), not a filed event; the faction article stays the authority.</p><p>The standing guard of Raventree Manor under the Regal Lion's occupation. Patrolling hallways and courtyard perimeters, they keep order among the staff and bar unauthorized entry to the fractured wings.</p><p><strong>Role:</strong> patrol sentry · <strong>tier:</strong> Garrison Footman · <strong>folder:</strong> Iron Legion / Regal Lion Knights.</p><h3>Art</h3><p>Token plate <code>portraits/regal-lion/regal-lion-manor-guard.png</code> — NPC Forge render, seed 610004, cut from a flat #FF00FF field. Prompt: <q>Clean cel-shaded character art in the style of dark fantasy military concept art, bold dark outlines, polished steel and gold lion crest heraldry, dark navy blue and crimson surcoats, cold iron plate, flat colours, crisp shading. A disciplined human sentry in gleaming steel plate and mail armor, wearing a royal navy-blue tabard with a gold Regal Lion insignia and an open-faced sallet helmet. Holding a tall steel spear and a heater shield. Full body, whole figure visible, three-quarter view, centred, isolated on a plain flat solid magenta background (#FF00FF), no floor, no ground shadow, no text, no border.</q></p>",
        "public": ""
      },
